# site/.env.example — copy to site/.env (git-ignored). Read by Astro at BUILD time (npm run build / npm run deploy).

# PUBLIC_CF_WEB_ANALYTICS_TOKEN
#   What: the site token of Cloudflare Web Analytics (page views, referrers, countries, Core Web Vitals; no cookies).
#   It is PUBLIC by design (it ends up in every page's <script data-cf-beacon>); kept here only so it is set in one place.
#   Empty = no Web Analytics script on the pages.
#   Get it: https://dash.cloudflare.com/3f0ee85fc436f30b05dd07e986c87115/web-analytics
#     → "Add a site" → hostname flowextractapi.com → Done → open the site → "Manage site" / "Edit site"
#     → choose the JavaScript snippet (manual setup) → copy the value after "token": in
#       <script defer src="https://static.cloudflareinsights.com/beacon.min.js" data-cf-beacon='{"token": "<THIS>"}'>
#   (32 hex characters). Then: npm run deploy.
PUBLIC_CF_WEB_ANALYTICS_TOKEN=
